 he's not dead because of course he's not  and he uses his  own lightning magic to help beat back  the zombies  even further now to be fair gaia does  say that he's already as good as dead  due to his injuries which suggests that  he might really die after this  battle is over but i honestly don't know  at this point  for all we know twilight of valhalla  might revive  gaia permanently or it could be just a  temporary extension of his life we'll  have to wait and see  the two lightning bros then start  absolutely smashing the zombies  as they clear a path towards megicula in  fact  their lightning attacks are so strong  that they tear right through the zombies  and they damage magikula herself  asta is amazed at how strong all of his  friends have become  and at this point in the story black  clover clearly wants to remind us that  the story itself  is not just about osta the protagonist  is not the only character who matters  the side characters have all been  improving they've all been getting  stronger and they all have an important  role to play  in this battle and in the story as a  whole  i mean just think back to what magna was  able to accomplish during this  spade kingdom war arc i don't think that  any of us had such high expectations  from magna but there you have it  i actually really like this and i  appreciate it because i'm generally not  a fan of series where one or two  characters do  literally everything and yeah everyone  else pretty much ends up being a  bystander  i'm not naming any names but i'm sure  that you guys can come up with some  examples of anime and manga that do this  in the comments below megikula's body  seems to have been destroyed by the  multiple lightning attacks launched by  lok and gaia  but thanks to her regeneration curse her  body begins to regenerate immediately  mekikula acknowledges that her current  form is still imperfect and so she is  nowhere near as strong as she could be  but even with that in mind she is still  r